# GT6 local source search

Java/tick is `gt6_code/gregtech6`. Art is `gt6_referencable_port_code/gregtech6_w`.
Both stay gitignored. `.cursorignore` / `.rgignore` re-include them for search.

When mapping a recipe or texture:

1. Grep/Glob those two trees. Do not conclude "not in the repo" from a CC-only search.
2. If Grep is empty, Shell `rg --no-ignore` with an explicit path. Instant Grep
   can still hide gitignored `!` paths.
3. Run `python tools/gt6_resolve.py "OP.capcellcon(MT.Al)"` (or the GT6 token)
   before marking a slot blocked. `unmapped` / `missing_prefix` is not a license
   to stand in a different part.
